---
import Container from '../../common/Container.astro';
import BadgeTag from '../../common/BadgeTag.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <BadgeTag variant="accent" size="sm" class="mb-4">
          Architectural Tenets
        </BadgeTag>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-normal text-[#111315] mb-4">
          Resilience, Speed & Observable Systems
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base font-sans text-[#4A5157] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Every architecture is engineered with distributed tracing, zero-trust security postures, and modular service boundaries that evolve alongside your enterprise roadmap.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-sans text-sm text-[#4A5157]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E7430B]"></span>
            Multi-region active-active deployment topologies
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E7430B]"></span>
            Strict semantic type safety across service boundaries
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E7430B]"></span>
            Deterministic infrastructure automation via GitOps
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#FAF7F5] border border-[#E6E2DF]">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#6B737A] mb-4">// System Architecture Overview</div>
        <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E6E2DF]">Edge Layer: Global CDN & WAF Routing</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#FDEEE8] text-[#E7430B] rounded-xl border border-[#E6E2DF]">Application: Micro-frontends & GraphQL Mesh</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E6E2DF]">Data & AI: Distributed Streaming & Vector Store</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
